{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-68","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与线段","englishTitle":"A straight line commensurable with a major straight line is itself also major.","book":10,"number":68,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":68,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","contentId":"euclid-10-68","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf82aec55d9d2ceeada568bf3330f5ebb45e4e988dbc7b6509698cfef516b775","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-68.statement","euclid-10-68.construction.1","euclid-10-68.construction.2","euclid-10-68.construction.3","euclid-10-68.proof.1","euclid-10-68.proof.2","euclid-10-68.proof.3","euclid-10-68.proof.4","euclid-10-68.proof.5","euclid-10-68.proof.6","euclid-10-68.proof.7","euclid-10-68.proof.8","euclid-10-68.proof.9","euclid-10-68.proof.10","euclid-10-68.conclusion","euclid-10-68.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-68.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a073142c3a95b59ebd6e855bd66e19dafb5198bd9231d6806eb2810c5d12dc3d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line commensurable with a major straight line is itself also major."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条有主要直线的第可公度直线本身也十分重要。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fdeb061dc3960dbb5b45d463cbe5b4ad5b4f7e0f0598181f78e400a985f6618","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be major, and let CD be commensurable with AB; I say that CD is major."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为主要人物,让CD成为可公度,AB成为主要人物;我说CD是主要人物。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d424a33e00fad2fde0253c307a18e2655b66ca28a12763262ae368e3189809c","citations":["euclid-10-39"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be divided at E; therefore AE, EB are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial. [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB分到E分,因此正方形分有AE、EB分直线不可公度分,有理分数为正方形分,矩形分数为中项无理线段分。 [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"980db57ff3e5f9785a6ddf55c99c7ee1919f3c08c77cec1f169c1ffc1d1702b2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the same construction be made as before."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"做同样的工程。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa29487db58d70c946cbd678e947f662e13edff85ac008a9afe9a980684e46c4","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, as AB is to CD, so is AE to CF, and EB to FD, therefore also, as AE is to CF, so is EB to FD. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,AB对CD的比等于AE对CF的比,EB对FD的比也等于AE对CF的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 AE 与 CF 之比；AE 与 CF 之比等于 EB 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd3cfc81e54e391bd0f5a44eb981a746dfd4d7c43c77bf0575bdb87e5267f554","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is commensurable with CD; therefore AE, EB are also commensurable with CF, FD respectively. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB为可公度,CD;因此,AE为EB,可公度,CF,FD。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb622f8a239ebed6e9b2a9783cc2456f392aba7bd8ff93653bf540ae25423a46","citations":["euclid-5-16","euclid-5-18","euclid-6-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as AE is to CF, so is EB to FD, alternately also, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD; [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)] therefore also, componendo, as AB is to BE, so is CD to DF; [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)] therefore also, as the square on AB is to the square on BE, so is the square on CD to the square on DF. [[VI. 20](/principles/euclid-6-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE对CF的比等于EB对FD的比,AE对EB的比等于CF对FD的比;因此,AB对BE的比等于CD对DF的比;因此,AB对BE对正方形的比等于CD对正方形的比；AE 与 CF 之比等于 EB 与 FD 之比；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比；AB 与 BE 之比等于 CD 与 DF 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)] [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)] [[VI. 20](/principles/euclid-6-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1eb5367999c3a5895d22c6990e10bff6f18936a0bcffc7b0ce068c720211162f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that, as the square on AB is to the square on AE, so also is the square on CD to the square on CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,AB正方形到AE正方形,CD正方形到AB正方形也这样。（相关点与线段：CF）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e9a925b80df0d6919df0a51da3489907c2a53a5e54a3d493a09f72cfa378e5a","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as the square on AB is to the squares on AE, EB, so is the square on CD to the squares on CF, FD; therefore also, alternately, as the square on AB is to the square on CD, so are the squares on AE, EB to the squares on CF, FD. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，以 AB 为边的正方形面积与以 AE、EB 为边的两个正方形面积之和的比，等于以 CD 为边的正方形面积与以 CF、FD 为边的两个正方形面积之和的比。交换比例中项后，以 AB 为边的正方形与以 CD 为边的正方形之比，等于以 AE、EB 为边的两个正方形与以 CF、FD 为边的两个正方形的面积和之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fcae86ed21d758c08bec8d8dae44526005014dc991b779446962dbca88ef882","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on AB is commensurable with the square on CD; therefore the squares on AE, EB are also commensurable with the squares on CF, FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB的正方形是可公度,CD是正方形,AE是年,EB也是可公度,CF是正方形,FD是正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b50c2bdf1960fab333f578c8fe40a3a14eceb267ffdc3164bb889b4b6835eff7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the squares on AE, EB together are rational; therefore the squares on CF, FD together are rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE,EB的正方形 总共是有理, 所以CF,FD的正方形 总共是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff2e32aabd5cb895eb3e3f78ebf88d6480a0f32d8204df71f7e40fb69cea880a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also twice the rectangle AE, EB is commensurable with twice the rectangle CF, FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,矩形 AE、EB和矩形 CF的比例也翻了一倍,为可公度和矩形 CF。（相关点与线段：FD）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bef9c8ec32353a0df5afb945f497e0befab9ed8f17726472e2c838168bc46b41","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And twice the rectangle AE, EB is medial; therefore twice the rectangle CF, FD is also medial. [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形 AE,EB是中项无理线段的两倍, 因此矩形 CF,FD也是中项无理线段的两倍。 [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0668989f52875a42f4eb795a0df2100626ba78cfa8618315f058a2c715ce3b3a","citations":["euclid-10-39"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CF, FD are straight lines incommensurable in square which make, at the same time, the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial; therefore the whole CD is the irrational straight line called major. [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,正方形的不可公度直线是CF,FD,同时使正方形直线的有理线达到正方形,但中项无理线段直线构成的矩形;因此,整个CD直线是无理线段所谓的主线。 [[X. 39](/principles/euclid-10-39)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa34d2a7c0e015d04e44745caa4298b506630f838cccc92be66349b93d428bcd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a straight line commensurable with the major straight line is major. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,一条有主要直线的第可公度直线是主要线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-68.source","contentId":"euclid-10-68","revisionId":"euclid-10-68@raw-cf82aec55d9d2cee","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4799e11e76230b59954402874ae46c8424903460046336e3197cef9f35782d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-68:euclid-10-39:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-68","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-68.construction.2","euclid-10-68.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-39","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68/","sourceLabel":"X. 39"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-68:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-68","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-68.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.68/","sourceLabel":"V. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-68:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-6